{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the following expressions the one equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a59c949701691b6022655188bda322a0b160aad8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{-1}b^{-1}}{a^{-3} - b^{-3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"81\" height=\"42\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/484fdcfea0c4d1cb004e9259758ebf383908f675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{a^2b^2}{b^2 - a^2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{a^2b^2}{b^3 - a^3}\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{ab}{b^3 - a^3}\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{a^3 - b^3}{ab}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{a^2b^2}{a - b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"580\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abeb596a39fe8742a897f8f6f74406f56b84b913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{-1}b^{-1}}{a^{-3} - b^{-3}} =  \\frac{\\frac{1}{ab}}{\\frac{1}{a^{3}}-\\frac{1}{b^{3}}} =  \\frac{\\frac{1}{ab}}{\\frac{1}{a^{3}}-\\frac{1}{b^{3}}}\\cdot\\frac{a^{3}b^{3}}{a^{3}b^{3}} = \\frac{a^{2}b^{2}}{b^{3}-a^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"382\" height=\"49\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0d5b8fdfd2bd98c8be0bad569663660c33f3438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a hr